{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41692","headline":"哭王赞府 · 陈陶","name":"哭王赞府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白水流今古，青山送死生。\n驱驰三楚掾，倏忽一空名。\n金玉埋臯壤，芝兰哭弟兄。\n龙头孤後进，鹏翅失前程。\n愁变风云色，悲连鼓角声。\n落星辞圣代，寒梦闭佳城。\n伊昔来江邑，从容副国英。\n德踰栖棘美，公亚饮冰清。\n大厦亡孤直，羣儒忆老成。\n白驹悲里巷，梁木恸簪缨。\n陇遂添新草，珠还满旧籝。\n苍苍难可问，原上晚烟横。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41692.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41692","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}